# Google OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID
# 1. Create a project in Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Go to APIs & Services > Credentials > Create Credentials > OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# 3. Application Type: Web application
# 4. Authorized JavaScript origins:
#    - http://localhost:5173
#    - https://your-production-domain.com
# 5. Copy the Client ID and paste below:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=1042476190686-sdsdjqsg7g6n9oki0p8ocnbca6tt5cco.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase (shared product database - cross-device marketplace listings)
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Settings -> API
# 3. Copy the Project URL and the "anon" public key (safe for browsers)
# 4. NEVER put the service-role secret key here
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://ahseghajdcsenniwtbeq.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_Ymrv_tfRBieTWl9GPY73BA_q0g2L4Z7
